{"type":"record","name":"StrikeInvasionPaceEvidence","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.strikeinvasion","doc":"The mission-pace projection of one strike. Internal evidence record of strike-invasion-service: it crosses a Kafka repartition topic (and, per strike, a state-store changelog) declared by that service, never a public contract. PRICE DOMAIN: every decimal(38,18) field accepts exactly the finite doubles whose shortest round-trip text has at most 18 fractional digits and magnitude below 1e20, and never negative zero; any other value is refused by the codec (never rounded) and the service counts and logs the refusal instead of publishing.","fields":[{"name":"strike","type":{"type":"bytes","logicalType":"decimal","precision":38,"scale":18}},{"name":"missionPaceScore","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"paceAccelerationScore","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"asOfEventTimeMs","type":"long","doc":"The frame's timestampMs, else the record time."}]}